# 行尾策略：GBK 批处理必须保持字节原样（core.autocrlf=true 会破坏 §6-2 已修好的 CRLF）
*.bat  -text
*.cmd  -text

# 文本文件统一 LF 入库，跨平台 clone 不再出现伪 diff
*.java text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.xml  text eol=lf
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.vue  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.jar  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
